n></span></span></span></span></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></font></strong></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;2018-2학기</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">&nbsp;한국장학재단 국가 교육근로장학사업&nbsp;신청자 중 순위 통과자</span></font></font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →&nbsp;3순위 이내(8분위 이하)</span></span></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; →&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">신청기간 중에는 원스톱서비스 로그인→학생지원→근로장학생 신청서 제출에서도 확인 가능</span></font></font></span></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span>정규학기 내 재학생 (휴학생, 초과학기자 제외)</font></font></span></font></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(평점 1.6) 이상</span></font></font></span></span></span></span></span></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">국가근로 우선선발순위: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FO